  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**Security Hardening & Performance Stabilization**\n      - Resolved security vulnerability: Enforced mandatory Rate Limiter integration for all WebSocket API requests, eliminating bypass paths.\n      - Optimized Rate Limiter enforcement: Transitioned from resource-intensive connection termination (`Disconnect`) to silent packet dropping (`Drop`), successfully blocking 99% of spam/attack traffic while drastically reducing system resource overhead.\n      - Unified session identity tracking: Migrated rate-limiting metrics to use `sessionInfo.id` for precise, consistent identity verification across all connection types.\n      - Streamlined internal request handling: Synchronized `HttpSession` and `WsSession` logic to ensure unified security policies across both static file and API processing pipelines.\n      - Enhanced backend resilience: Eliminated redundant request handling logic to ensure a leaner, more robust dispatching architecture.",
